<h3 class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__name"><a href="https://www.jotform.com/help/how-to-align-your-forms-to-a-right-to-left-direction/">Jotform</a></h3>
<p class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__best"><strong>Best for:</strong> Teams deep in Jotform who don't want to migrate</p>
<hr class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__divider">
<ul class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__list">
<li class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__item">Paste a custom CSS block in the Form Designer</li>
<li class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__item">Works on any existing form</li>
<li class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-cmp__item">Covers labels, checkboxes, radios, matrix grids</li>
