<h2 class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-lang__h2" id="fmstr-cmp-rtl-lang-h2">RTL languages: what you need to know before shipping</h2>
<p class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-lang__intro">Six RTL scripts cover almost every audience you will hit. Each one has its own font and numeral gotcha that the form builder needs to handle correctly.</p>
</div>

<div class="fmstr-cmp-rtl-lang__tablewrap">
